Again, if we actually want to keep that change, we need to assign it to an object. Maybe we just re-assign it to the same object name


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
clean_toy_data <- mutate(clean_toy_data, log_dbh = log(dbh)) 

clean_toy_data
