## Solution


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
all_dat <- select(clim, -(lon:lat)) |> 
    full_join(geoh) |>
    full_join(tree) |>
    select(-(Longitude:Latitude)) |> 
    filter(!is.na(Island)) |> 
    relocate(c(Island:Census, lon:lat), .after = PlotID) |> 
    rename(Plot_ID = PlotID)
```
